#. comic310 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddmad.gif, kobastand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic310.htm:77
msgctxt "comic310#p1.1"
msgid "Keilbasa? What are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

#. comic310 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddmad.gif, kobastand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic310.htm:81
msgctxt "comic310#p1.2"
msgid "It's Kobayashi, and what does <i>anyone</i> do slumped over a bar?"
msgstr ""

#. comic310 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddright.gif, kobablink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic310.htm:134
msgctxt "comic310#p2.1"
msgid "But you were helplessly adrift in netspace. How the heck did you find your way here?"
msgstr ""

#. comic310 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddright.gif, kobablink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic310.htm:138
msgctxt "comic310#p2.2"
msgid "As if I'd tell you."
msgstr ""

#. comic310 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: kobahead.gif
#: kidradd/comic310.htm:190
msgctxt "comic310#p3.1"
msgid "The ways of the ninja are bound by secrecy, never to cross the ears of the uninitiated. And yet these ways bear such complexity that mere mortals would not understand even if told plainly."
msgstr ""

#. comic310 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, kobastand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic310.htm:241
msgctxt "comic310#p4.1"
